# Simple OS – updates of Simple OS itself: the package "simpleos" (tools, settings, look) brings the system to the
# newest Simple OS edition through Software Updates, like any Debian update. "latest" is always the newest release
# on GitHub; every release carries the signed repository (tools/release.sh). Key: simpleos-archive-keyring.asc
Types: deb
URIs: https://github.com/FreakySneaky787/simple-os/releases/latest/download/
Suites: ./
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/simpleos-archive-keyring.asc
